    "body": "A native macOS **menu bar** todo app \u2014 CRUD, drag-to-reorder, swipe between days with full history, roll-over of unfinished tasks, today's count in the menu bar, and optional iCloud sync.\n\n### Install\n1. Download **TodoPop-v1.0.0.zip** below and unzip it.\n2. Move **TodoPop.app** to `/Applications`. It lives in your menu bar \u2014 no Dock icon.\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f This build is **not notarized** (no paid Apple Developer account), so on first launch macOS will say it's from an unidentified developer. To open it once:\n> - **Right-click** TodoPop.app \u2192 **Open** \u2192 **Open**, or\n> - run: `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/TodoPop.app`\n>\n> After that it opens normally. Requires macOS 14+.\n\n### Quit\nOpen the panel \u2192 **\u22ef** \u2192 **Quit TodoPop**.\n"
